      "Three shades cover new, aged and dark teak",
      "Wipes on with a rag — no special applicator needed",
      "Fast drying, so a small set of furniture is a morning job",
      "Stocked almost everywhere marine supplies are sold",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Thinner build than premium sealers; expect more frequent coats",
      "Colour can look slightly flat next to the Golden Teak Oil",
    ],
    bottomLine:
      "Good, cheap, honest protection. If you would rather spend fifteen minutes twice a year than money once, this is the sensible buy.",
